chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Transaction Fees"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the book's own source at tag third_edition_print1. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-15T00:00:00Z; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60, chx:P61, chx:P62, chx:P63, chx:P64, chx:P65, chx:P66, chx:P67, chx:P68, chx:P69, chx:P70, chx:P71, chx:P72 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does Chapter 9 of Mastering Bitcoin (3rd edition) say about transaction fees, which of its statements can be recomputed or run on Bitcoin Core 31.1 and on the real chain, and what has changed in Bitcoin Core, the BIPs and the fee market since the book went to print?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-15." .
